---
// Constellation of stack icons: hardware tribe (left, copper), software tribe
// (right, cyan), and two apex anchors (.Nt at top, Ax at bottom). Letter-marks
// only — no real logos — keeping the catalog feel of an astronomical chart.
//
// The bridge polyline crosses three points: industrial protocols (left) ->
// .NET (apex) -> JetBrains (right), tracing the actual arc of Carlos's
// career rather than a literal tagline reference.
---

<svg class="lines" viewBox="0 0 1000 625" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
  <polyline class="ln-hardware" points="40,350 190,275 220,475" />
  <line class="ln-hardware" x1="150" y1="200" x2="190" y2="275" />
